{"contract_version":"0.1","session_id":"exercise-a-high-001","scenario_id":"candidate-assessment-a-ambiguous-structure","scenario_version":"candidate-assessment-a-v0.1","started_at":"2026-08-05T00:30:00Z","ended_at":"2026-08-05T00:35:00Z","participants":[{"participant_id":"candidate_a_high","speaker_type":"user","agent_role":null},{"participant_id":"ai_a_study","speaker_type":"ai","agent_role":"学習環境を重視する参加者"},{"participant_id":"ai_a_community","speaker_type":"ai","agent_role":"学生交流を重視する参加者"},{"participant_id":"ai_a_operations","speaker_type":"ai","agent_role":"運用と包摂性を重視する参加者"}],"messages":[{"message_id":"m001","participant_id":"ai_a_study","speaker_type":"ai","text":"静かな学習場所を求める学生が多いので、予約制の自習室を軸に考えたいです。","phase":"problem_definition","move":"clarify_goal","start_ms":10000,"end_ms":18000,"generation_id":"g001"},{"message_id":"m002","participant_id":"ai_a_community","speaker_type":"ai","text":"交流の機会も不足しているので、学生企画を開ける空間にしたいです。","phase":"problem_definition","move":"propose_idea","start_ms":20000,"end_ms":28000,"generation_id":"g002"},{"message_id":"m003","participant_id":"ai_a_operations","speaker_type":"ai","text":"一つの部屋で両方を満たせるのか、運用面の衝突がありそうです。","phase":"problem_definition","move":"challenge","start_ms":30000,"end_ms":37000,"generation_id":"g003"},{"message_id":"m004","participant_id":"candidate_a_high","speaker_type":"user","text":"目的は夜間の学習場所不足を最優先で解消することです。対象は18時以降に学内へ残る学生、成功は利用率と満足度、制約は予算300万円と管理人員据え置きで整理しましょう。","phase":"problem_definition","move":"clarify_goal","start_ms":40000,"end_ms":48000,"generation_id":null},{"message_id":"m005","participant_id":"ai_a_community","speaker_type":"ai","text":"交流ニーズはどの時間帯で扱う想定でしょうか。","phase":"problem_definition","move":"ask_question","start_ms":50000,"end_ms":55000,"generation_id":"g004"},{"message_id":"m006","participant_id":"candidate_a_high","speaker_type":"user","text":"利用時間は平日18時から22時、静音を原則、交流は週1回・最大20人、既存動線を維持し追加改修なしとします。","phase":"problem_definition","move":"define_scope","start_ms":57000,"end_ms":67000,"generation_id":null},{"message_id":"m007","participant_id":"candidate_a_high","speaker_type":"user","text":"比較基準を利用率、満足度、騒音苦情、運営工数、アクセシビリティの5点にし、優先順位は安全・包摂性、学習効果、運営負荷の順にします。","phase":"problem_definition","move":"define_criteria","start_ms":69000,"end_ms":77000,"generation_id":null},{"message_id":"m008","participant_id":"ai_a_study","speaker_type":"ai","text":"静音時間が中心なら、予約枠を細かくして回転率を上げられそうです。","phase":"idea_generation","move":"integrate","start_ms":82000,"end_ms":90000,"generation_id":"g005"},{"message_id":"m009","participant_id":"candidate_a_high","speaker_type":"user","text":"残り10分なので、まず二案を並べます。Aは静音専用、Bは時間帯分離です。Bは可動机、予約上限、静音日と交流日の掲示を組み合わせ、既存設備だけで試せます。","phase":"idea_generation","move":"propose_idea","start_ms":92000,"end_ms":101000,"generation_id":null},{"message_id":"m010","participant_id":"ai_a_community","speaker_type":"ai","text":"交流日に騒音が出た場合、授業への影響をどう抑えますか。","phase":"idea_generation","move":"ask_question","start_ms":103000,"end_ms":110000,"generation_id":"g006"},{"message_id":"m011","participant_id":"candidate_a_high","speaker_type":"user","text":"騒音懸念は授業への影響だと理解しました。交流日は授業終了後、20人上限、事前予約、終了後15分の原状復帰を条件にし、苦情が月2件を超えたら中止します。","phase":"idea_generation","move":"respond_to_question","start_ms":112000,"end_ms":121000,"generation_id":null},{"message_id":"m012","participant_id":"ai_a_community","speaker_type":"ai","text":"実は以前、近隣教室から騒音への苦情がありました。イベント利用には慎重さが必要です。","phase":"option_comparison","move":"challenge","start_ms":126000,"end_ms":135000,"generation_id":"g007"},{"message_id":"m013","participant_id":"ai_a_study","speaker_type":"ai","text":"静音専用案と時間帯分離案を、利用率と苦情リスクで比べましょう。","phase":"option_comparison","move":"compare_options","start_ms":137000,"end_ms":146000,"generation_id":"g008"},{"message_id":"m014","participant_id":"candidate_a_high","speaker_type":"user","text":"Aは運営が単純で苦情リスクが低い一方、交流ニーズを捨てます。Bは両ニーズを満たすが運営工数が増えます。予算内かつ6か月検証可能なのでBを第一候補、Aを撤退時の代替とします。","phase":"option_comparison","move":"compare_options","start_ms":148000,"end_ms":160000,"generation_id":null},{"message_id":"m015","participant_id":"ai_a_operations","speaker_type":"ai","text":"車椅子動線の大規模改修は予算外です。配置変更だけで利用できる設計が必要です。","phase":"option_comparison","move":"challenge","start_ms":162000,"end_ms":172000,"generation_id":"g009"},{"message_id":"m016","participant_id":"candidate_a_high","speaker_type":"user","text":"動線制約を踏まえ、机間90センチを確保し、配置図を事前確認します。騒音と動線の二つの懸念を条件へ統合し、人数、配置、中止基準を一枚の運用表にします。","phase":"option_comparison","move":"integrate","start_ms":174000,"end_ms":185000,"generation_id":null},{"message_id":"m017","participant_id":"candidate_a_high","speaker_type":"user","text":"6か月B案を実証し、月次で利用率60%以上、満足度4.0以上、苦情月1件以下、追加運営工数週3時間以内を確認します。3か月で未達が2項目以上なら静音専用Aへ切り替えます。","phase":"decision","move":"propose_decision","start_ms":190000,"end_ms":203000,"generation_id":null},{"message_id":"m018","participant_id":"ai_a_study","speaker_type":"ai","text":"静音時間が中心なら賛成です。","phase":"decision","move":"support","start_ms":205000,"end_ms":210000,"generation_id":"g010"},{"message_id":"m019","participant_id":"ai_a_community","speaker_type":"ai","text":"交流日の人数上限があれば賛成できます。","phase":"decision","move":"support","start_ms":212000,"end_ms":218000,"generation_id":"g011"},{"message_id":"m020","participant_id":"candidate_a_high","speaker_type":"user","text":"学習重視、交流重視、運用・包摂性の各立場から未解決点はありますか。なければB案、20人上限、90センチ動線、中止・撤退条件付きで合意とします。","phase":"decision","move":"confirm_consensus","start_ms":220000,"end_ms":229000,"generation_id":null},{"message_id":"m021","participant_id":"candidate_a_high","speaker_type":"user","text":"残り時間で決定事項と担当を確認します。初月は運用担当が配置図と予約手順、学生側が周知、毎月指標を共有し、3か月で中間レビュー、6か月で継続判断します。","phase":"summary","move":"summarize","start_ms":235000,"end_ms":248000,"generation_id":null}],"events":[{"event_id":"ev_msg_001","event":"AI_UTTERANCE_COMMITTED","timestamp_ms":18000,"participant_id":"ai_a_study","generation_id":"g001","message_id":"m001"},{"event_id":"ev_msg_002","event":"AI_UTTERANCE_COMMITTED","timestamp_ms":28000,"participant_id":"ai_a_community","generation_id":"g002","message_id":"m002"},{"event_id":"ev_msg_003",